Removes the lag of huge decks and relic piles: hundreds or thousands of cards, hundreds of relics, in singleplayer and especially in co-op.

It changes nothing about the game itself: same rules, same results, same saves. It only computes the same things faster.

[h2]What it fixes[/h2]
Measured in game, against the unmodified game on the same state:
[list]
[*][b]Co-op:[/b] the state check the game runs after every action went from 1.7 s to 40 ms (2830 combat cards, 370 relics).
[*][b]Combat:[/b] the refresh after every action (card costs, hand, intents, enchantments) is up to 12x faster.
[*][b]Deck view:[/b] sorting no longer freezes the game (30–110 ms → under 5 ms), and opening or sorting a card grid stutters less.
[*][b]Relics:[/b] hundreds of relics no longer slow down every mouse move.
[/list]

[h2]Co-op[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Client-side only:[/b] players without the mod can join you. Each player gets the speed-up only if they have it.
[*][b]Same results as the unmodified game:[/b] every optimization was checked against vanilla on large states, and in co-op the mod regularly re-runs the vanilla state check and compares; on any difference it goes back to vanilla for the session.
[/list]

[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
[list]
[*]No dependencies. Tested with BaseLib, Limitless and CampfireTrade.
[*]With Limitless, scrolling enchanted cards in card grids is faster too.
[*]If another mod changes the same game code, the overlapping optimization steps aside.
[*]After a game or mod update, an optimization whose underlying code changed turns itself off (logged) instead of guessing.
[/list]

[h2]Troubleshooting[/h2]
In the console ([b]`[/b] key, [b]*[/b] or [b]^[/b] on AZERTY):
[list]
[*][b]bdopt[/b] — state of each optimization.
[*][b]bdopt off[/b] / [b]bdopt on[/b] — vanilla behavior / optimizations back on, no restart needed.
[/list]
If something looks wrong, check whether it still happens with [b]bdopt off[/b], then report it with your log ([i]%APPDATA%\SlayTheSpire2\logs[/i]).

Source code (MIT): https://github.com/TheKiwi7/big-deck-optimization
